<<Scene #000000 0.985>>

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>

Zoran: Ah, patience... 
Zoran: A virtue so many lack...
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Fortunately, I excel at it.
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I trust some may rub off on you if you listen to me Your Majesty?

<<LookAt 2 7>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>  
<<Scene #000000 0.585>>  
Zoran: Look upon your so-called mighty fortress.  
Zoran: Every soldier within—willing to die for you.  
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>  
Zoran: They fight, they fall, and more take their place...  
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>  
Zoran: And yet, there are never enough.  

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Do you see that number slowly ticking upward?
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: That’s the unit count.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The crafty work of the local War Commissar's recrutment campaign, ha-ha.
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The higher that number, the stronger your assault will be.

<<LookAt 0 7>>
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Of course, your enemies aren’t just sitting around picking their noses...
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Their towers are regenerating too. So… perhaps waiting too long isn’t ideal, either.

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Timing, your majesty, is everything. 
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: A decisive ruler knows when to strike.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>> 
<<LookAt 1 7>>
Zoran: And a... less decisive one, well, let's not go there, shall we?

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Watch those numbers, prepare your forces, and strike when the odds are in your favor.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>> 
Zoran: Even you can manage that, I’m sure.

<<LookAt 1 10>>
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Or shall I spell it out again for you? No?  

